<title>CANADA: Cascades to buy Perkins shares.</title>
<headline>Cascades to buy Perkins shares.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cascades Inc said on Tuesday that it agreed to buy 14 millon preferred shares, series A of Perkins Papers Ltd held by Abitibi-Price Inc.</p>
<p>The total purchase price was C$14.5 million, plus accrued dividends.</p>
<p>The shares are convertible at any time into common shares of Perkins. Cascades holds 76 percent of the outstanding common shares of Perkins. If Cascades exercised the conversion right of the preferred shares, its holding would increase to 77.5 percent, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Montreal bureau (514) 985-2434</p>
</text>
